* Domain 3\nClaude Code
** F1 · Architecture & Setup
*** T1 What it IS
**** Agentic CLI = "Claude with hands"
**** NOT chat / NOT autocomplete
**** Contractor vs Copilot spell-checker
**** Loop = Plan -> Tool -> Observe -> self-correct
**** Only DISK survives sessions
**** CLAUDE.md loaded once, then RESIDENT
*** T2 Tool System (9)
**** Read Write Edit Bash
**** Glob(name) Grep(text)
**** WebSearch WebFetch Agent
**** **Edit=surgical · Write=full overwrite**
*** T3 /init
**** starter CLAUDE.md (name, entry pts, stack, rules)
**** **starter, NEVER finished -> review required**
*** T4 Managing context
**** 4 inputs: path · @ref · URL · inline
**** include = changes behaviour (a DIAL)
**** exclude via deny rule (a WALL)
**** **deny rules -> settings.json, NOT CLAUDE.md**
**** compaction = summarise (auto or /compact)
*** T5 Permission modes
**** default · accept edits · plan
**** don't ask · bypass · auto
**** **ORDER: hook -> permission -> tool**
**** **auto = supervised · bypass = unsupervised**
**** session-wide · working dir only · protected paths
** F2 · The CLAUDE.md System
*** T6 4 scopes (concatenated)
**** managed (org, can't exclude, ONLY enforcement)
**** user (~/.claude, never shared)
**** project (repo root, COMMITTED, shared)
**** local (CLAUDE.local.md, gitignored)
*** T7 Precedence
**** **CLAUDE.md conflict = NON-DETERMINISTIC**
**** complementary = both apply
**** /memory lists · /context inspects
**** vs auto-memory (self-accumulating, on disk)
**** Trap: org rule -> managed only
**** Trap: team rule in user file -> DRIFT
*** T8 Subdirectory CLAUDE.md
**** LAZY: loads on a READ in that folder
**** ADDS to root, never replaces
**** placement = the scope (no manifest)
*** T9 Excluding files
**** read deny in settings.json (glob: * vs **)
**** **PERMISSIONS MERGE · DENY beats ALLOW (any layer)**
**** deny != subprocess -> need sandboxing
**** no .claudeignore · .gitignore NOT respected
*** T10 Instruction design
**** specific · actionable · unambiguous
**** encode only what Claude can't know
**** test: delete line -> behaviour change?
*** T11 Team patterns
**** front/back/full-stack + SECURITY (early)
**** anti: narrative doc · tool duplication
** F3 · Commands / Skills / Subagents
*** Stack: CLAUDE.md < SKILLS < SUBAGENTS
*** T12 Slash commands
**** filename = keyword · body = prompt
**** $ARGUMENTS = dynamic
**** scope by location (project=shared, user=personal)
*** T13 Command design
**** narrow scope · verb-noun names
**** distribute: commit / managed settings
**** don't duplicate CLAUDE.md
*** T14 What skills are
**** description-matched, auto-loads
**** commands = SUBSET of skills
**** build if: frequency+complexity+reusability
*** T15 Authoring skills
**** a DIRECTORY: .claude/skills/<name>/skill.md
**** **front matter OPTIONAL · body always loads**
**** **DESCRIPTION drives matching (like D2 tools)**
**** allowed=pre-approve · disallowed=REMOVE (asymmetric)
**** no trigger/version/author fields
*** T16-17 Subagents
**** autonomous worker, own context+tools
**** orchestrator pattern; parallel / oversized tasks
**** structured returns · never swallow errors
** F4 · Hooks
*** Shell-level, outside context, can't prompt away
*** T18 Cadence
**** session (observe) · turn (block) · tool
**** **pre=block · post=react (already ran)**
**** stop = end-of-TURN (many/session)
**** notification = route only
*** T21 Four common events
**** pre-tool-use · post-tool-use · stop · notification
**** block an action -> ALWAYS pre-tool-use
*** T22 Exit codes / impl
**** **0=go · 2=BLOCK · 1/other=non-blocking (runs)**
**** register in settings.json · parallel · timeout
**** allow-list / block-list / dry-run
*** T23 Applications
**** post: format, test, audit, cost
**** pre: safety net (rm -rf, DROP TABLE)
**** pre-log=intent · post-log=results
** F5 · Plan / SDK / CI-CD
*** T19-20 Plan mode
**** read-only think -> approval gate -> execute
**** IS a permission mode (shift+tab / /plan)
**** good plan = steps + named files + risks
**** undo 10s->skip · 30min->plan
**** re-plan on broken assumption; watch improvisation
*** T24 Agent SDK
**** (was Claude Code SDK)
**** your CODE drives; streams events
**** **SDK = agent loop · API = one completion**
*** T25 CI/CD
**** **-p = non-interactive; forget it -> HANG**
**** atomic · self-contained · JSON · idempotent
**** GitHub: official action + API key secret
**** minimum permissions · step timeout

